      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1857, George Kemp bought the mill and renamed the settlement Kemp Mill, setting the name that endures today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kemp_Mill%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Kemps Mill boasts creekside walkways and quiet hiking trails that let drivers enjoy a peaceful suburban escape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
